<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Projects — Periodic Projects</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#14162B;
    --card:#1E2140;
    --teal:#4FE0C4;
    --coral:#FF6B4A;
    --gold:#FFC857;
    --violet:#B69CFF;
    --paper:#F2F0E9;
    --paper-dim:#B8B7C9;
  }

  *{ box-sizing:border-box; }

  html,body{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    background:var(--ink);
    color:var(--paper);
    font-family:'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif;
    min-height:100vh;
  }

  a{ color:inherit; text-decoration:none; }
  a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible{
    outline:3px solid var(--gold);
    outline-offset:3px;
  }

  header{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    padding:1.75rem clamp(1.25rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
  }

  .wordmark{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.85rem;
    letter-spacing:0.12em;
    color:var(--paper-dim);
    text-transform:uppercase;
  }

  nav a{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.85rem;
    letter-spacing:0.08em;
    padding:0.55rem 1rem;
    border:1px solid rgba(242,240,233,0.25);
    border-radius:6px;
    transition:border-color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
  }
  nav a:hover{
    border-color:var(--teal);
    background:rgba(79,224,196,0.08);
    transform:translateY(-1px);
  }

  main{
    padding:1rem clamp(1.25rem, 5vw, 3.5rem) 5rem;
    max-width:1100px;
    margin:0 auto;
  }

  .intro{
    text-align:center;
    margin:1.5rem auto 3.5rem;
    max-width:42ch;
  }

  h1{
    font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    margin:0 0 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing:-0.02em;
  }

  .intro p{
    color:var(--paper-dim);
    font-size:1.05rem;
    line-height:1.6;
    margin:0;
  }

  .table{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));
    gap:1rem;
  }

  .tile{
    position:relative;
    background:linear-gradient(155deg, var(--card), #171933);
    border:2px solid var(--tile-color, var(--teal));
    border-radius:16px;
    padding:1rem;
    aspect-ratio:1;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    justify-content:space-between;
    transition:transform 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease;
    cursor:default;
  }
  .tile:hover{
    transform:translateY(-6px);
    box-shadow:0 20px 40px -18px var(--tile-color, var(--teal));
  }

  .tile .num{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.8rem;
    color:var(--tile-color, var(--teal));
  }

  .tile .sym{
    font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:2.4rem;
    line-height:1;
  }

  .tile .name{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.7rem;
    letter-spacing:0.06em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--paper-dim);
  }

  .tile .status{
    position:absolute;
    top:0.85rem;
    right:0.85rem;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.6rem;
    letter-spacing:0.08em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--tile-color, var(--teal));
    opacity:0.85;
  }

  footer{
    text-align:center;
    padding:1.5rem;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.75rem;
    color:rgba(184,183,201,0.6);
    letter-spacing:0.06em;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <span class="wordmark">Lab Notebook</span>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="intro">
      <h1>The Table</h1>
      <p>Every project settles somewhere between stable and experimental. Hover an element to feel its charge.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="table">
      <div class="tile" style="--tile-color:#4FE0C4;">
        <span class="status">Stable</span>
        <span class="num">01</span>
        <span class="sym">Rn</span>
        <span class="name">Routine Notebook</span>
      </div>

      <div class="tile" style="--tile-color:#FF6B4A;">
        <span class="status">Reactive</span>
        <span class="num">02</span>
        <span class="sym">Bt</span>
        <span class="name">Budget Tracker</span>
      </div>

      <div class="tile" style="--tile-color:#FFC857;">
        <span class="status">In progress</span>
        <span class="num">03</span>
        <span class="sym">Wg</span>
        <span class="name">Weather Glass</span>
      </div>

      <div class="tile" style="--tile-color:#B69CFF;">
        <span class="status">Experimental</span>
        <span class="num">04</span>
        <span class="sym">Dj</span>
        <span class="name">Desk Jockey</span>
      </div>

      <div class="tile" style="--tile-color:#4FE0C4;">
        <span class="status">Stable</span>
        <span class="num">05</span>
        <span class="sym">Ph</span>
        <span class="name">Plant Health</span>
      </div>

      <div class="tile" style="--tile-color:#FF6B4A;">
        <span class="status">Archived</span>
        <span class="num">06</span>
        <span class="sym">Ol</span>
        <span class="name">Old Ledger</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    Periodic Projects &middot; back to <a href="index.html" style="text-decoration:underline;">Home</a>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>